jerumednexus-gateway (1.1.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Hardened auth (bcrypt), CSRF, rate limiting, session lifetime.
  * API token required on HTTP ingestion server.
  * Complete HL7 escape including CR/LF/FS to prevent framing injection.
  * MSH-18 charset coherent with wire encoding; timezone-aware timestamps.
  * ACK correlation via MSH-10 to prevent cross-message ACK confusion.
  * Real LOINC codes for previously-placeholder analytes.
  * Cross-platform signal handling (Windows dev support).
  * Plug-and-play device detection via udev.
  * .deb packaging + Debian-native install with dedicated system user.

 -- Jerumed Nexus GmbH <info@jerumed-nexus.ch>  Mon, 25 Aug 2025 12:00:00 +0200

